==Battleground==
*1 [[Shakurel Face]] spawns as the boss.
*3 [[Shakurel Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*1 [[Shakurel Gory]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*5 [[Shakurel Doge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*3 [[Shakurel Gory|Shakurel Gories]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*7 [[Shakurel Doge]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*7 [[Shakurel Gory|Shakurel Gories]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shakurel Doge]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shakurel Gory|Shakurel Gories]] spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win. Fight Shakurel Face as you would [[The Face|The Normal Face]].

